  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"354\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"122\">• Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"125\">Canmake is one of Japan’s most beloved cosmetic brands, known for its affordable prices, cute packaging, and high-quality formulas. Loved by both teens and adults, Canmake delivers effortless, natural beauty with a playful touch.</p><p data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"603\"><strong data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"382\">• Product Description:</strong><br data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"385\">From bestselling mascaras and creamy blushes to glossy lip tints and pore-blurring primers, Canmake offers a wide range of makeup essentials designed for soft, glowy, and youthful looks. All products are made in Japan.</p><p data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"809\"><strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"639\">• USP (Unique Selling Points):</strong><br data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"642\">✔ Ships across the U.S.<br data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"668\">✔ Weekly new arrivals directly from Japan<br data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"712\">✔ Monthly sales and exclusive campaigns<br data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"754\">✔ Perfect for natural makeup lovers and J-beauty fans</p><p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"963\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"833\">• Commission Info:</strong><br data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"836\">10% commission per order completed via your affiliate link. Earnings are automatically paid via PayPal after each 30-day cycle.</p><p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1148\"><strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"980\">• Why Join?</strong><br data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"983\">Whether you're a beauty creator, J-beauty enthusiast, or makeup minimalist, this is your chance to share Japan’s cutest cult-favorite brand and earn while you do it!</p></div></div>",
